Place your product/category .webp images in this folder using the same
filenames referenced in backend/seed/seeddatabase.js, e.g.:
almonds.webp, apple.webp, banana.webp, dates.webp, raisins.webp,
avacado-juice.webp, watermelon-juice.webp, chia-seeds.webp,
watermelon-seeds.webp, sunflower-seeds.webp, healthy-milkshake.webp,
hero-food-bowl.webp, dry-fruits.webp, fruits.webp, juices.webp,
papaya.webp, pomogranate.webp, mid-morning-box.webp, evening-box.webp,
nutrisphere-fruit-logo.webp, botanical-bg.webp
